machine mill/kiln
  states
    idle
    working

  transition transform()
    idle -> working
    guard ?unit `is` clay/raw
    retract ?unit `is` clay/raw
    assert ?unit `is` brick/fired
    assert self `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` working
    retract self `state`

  transition reset()
    working -> idle
    assert self `state` idle
    retract self `state`

